in the Bahamas ♪</i>

22
00:01:02.761 --> 00:01:04.228
<i>♪ Off of billions looted ♪</i>

23
00:01:06.195 --> 00:01:07.561
<i>♪ Now can you clap? ♪</i>

24
00:01:11.970 --> 00:01:13.163
<i>♪ Now can you clap? ♪</i>

25
00:01:13.164 --> 00:01:14.698
(CAMERAS CLICKING)

26
00:01:14.699 --> 00:01:18.008
<i>♪ Now can you clap
for them killers? ♪</i>

27
00:01:18.009 --> 00:01:20.976
<i>♪ Give it up
for them gangsters ♪</i>

28
00:01:20.977 --> 00:01:22.642
<i>♪ One time for the killers ♪</i>

29
00:01:24.018 --> 00:01:26.617
<i>♪ Double up
for them gangsters ♪</i>

30
00:01:26.618 --> 00:01:28.482
