Now run it back ♪</i>

40
00:01:44.764 --> 00:01:47.532
<i>♪ Ay, so what Scorsese
Got all them money stacks ♪</i>

41
00:01:47.533 --> 00:01:49.234
<i>♪ Long as his lens
never looks ♪</i>

42
00:01:49.235 --> 00:01:50.841
<i>♪ At the real maniacs ♪</i>

43
00:01:50.842 --> 00:01:53.208
<i>♪ Clap for them killers ♪</i>

44
00:01:53.209 --> 00:01:56.044
<i>♪ Give it up
for them gangsters ♪</i>

45
00:01:56.045 --> 00:01:59.016
<i>♪ One time for the killers ♪</i>

46
