the carpet's red.

56
00:03:20.224 --> 00:03:21.327
(IN RUSSIAN)

57
00:03:21.328 --> 00:03:22.762
- (MUFFLED GUNSHOTS)
- (GROANS)

58
00:03:25.433 --> 00:03:27.701
