would 10 seconds make?

62
00:03:45.822 --> 00:03:46.984
(PETROV IN RUSSIAN)

63
00:03:50.823 --> 00:03:52.188
- (IN ENGLISH) It can't.
- (MUFFLED GUNSHOT)

64
00:03:52.189 --> 00:03:53.463
