325
00:16:49.232 --> 00:16:50.371
<i>♪ All right ♪</i>

326
00:16:51.544 --> 00:16:52.942
<i>♪ Mm-hmm ♪</i>

327
00:16:52.943 --> 00:16:56.441
<i>♪ I really like
the way you move ♪</i>

328
00:16:56.442 --> 00:16:59.248
<i>♪ You're like
a pocket full of jewels ♪</i>

329
00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:02.719
<i>♪ The headline in my news ♪</i>

330
00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:04.152
- (MUFFLED GUNSHOT)
- (SPLATTER)

331
00:17:04.153 --> 00:17:07.649
<i>♪ I wanna tell you
I do, I do, I do ♪</i>

332
00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:10.325
