536
00:27:30.113 --> 00:27:31.113
Me.

537
00:27:31.743 --> 00:27:33.380
I'm the target.

538
00:27:33.381 --> 00:27:34.745
I'll pay. Don't worry.

539
00:27:34.746 --> 00:27:36.113
