540
00:27:36.114 --> 00:27:38.982
Can you explain to me
exactly what is going on?

541
00:27:38.983 --> 00:27:42.693
I got a disease.
You know, the headaches.

542
00:27:43.760 --> 00:27:45.993
I'm... I'm getting
the shakes and...

543
